<%- include("partials/head") %>
<%- include("partials/nav") %>

<main id="main-content" class="main-shell">
  <section class="about-card reveal-up">
    <p class="eyebrow">About This Memorial</p>
    <h1>Who Is Java?</h1>
    <p>
      Java was my real cat, with strong opinions about snacks, naps, and
      chewing absolutely everything in sight.
    </p>
    <p>
      He had pica, so many entries are about the eternal struggle to keep socks,
      cardboard, and charging cables out of reach.
    </p>
    <p>
      This memorial site preserves her memory through posts and images managed
      in Supabase, so updates are easy while keeping the archive focused.
    </p>
    <p>
      Every page under <code>/java</code> is dedicated to Java's archive.
    </p>

    <div class="about-highlights">
      <article>
        <h2>What's preserved</h2>
        <p>Java's posts, moods, and memories are kept in the same Supabase-backed workflow used by admin.</p>
      </article>
      <article>
        <h2>Media archive</h2>
        <p>Photos are served from Supabase Storage and tied to each post with image metadata.</p>
      </article>
      <article>
        <h2>Blog selector</h2>
        <p>The root page acts as a directory so visitors can choose Java's blog or future cat blogs.</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>
</main>

<%- include("partials/footer") %>
